{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >From a small caf\u00e9 to a place with a unique atmosphere</h2>Start your adventure with a modest space and expand it into an elegant caf\u00e9 where everyone will want to stop in for a cup of aromatic coffee and a fresh dessert. Create an atmosphere that will make your place unique.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Serve the best products</h2>Break the perfect coffee and fresh juices. Diversify your offerings with cakes, croissants, muffins, and ice cream sundaes. Ensure quality and freshness so even the most discerning customers are delighted.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expand and decorate your caf\u00e9</h2>Add new tables, chairs, cabinets, and refrigerators to make your place increasingly functional and attractive. Create a cozy interior by decorating it with paintings and plants. Your caf\u00e9 will attract guests not only with its flavor but also with its atmosphere.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Management and Success</h2>Serve customers efficiently and professionally. Fulfill orders, accept cash or card payments, maintain inventory, and improve your offerings daily. Over time, you can become a true coffee shop tycoon, winning the hearts of customers and reaping ever-increasing profits.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3995700?t=1760099720","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995700/58ae603b1d1d41056fa6c3b2f56403c4e201474b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760099720","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995700/77308b8bdb8e1cde860f947378eecc8f322f9245/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760099720","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3995700/77308b8bdb8e1cde860f947378eecc8f322f9245/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760099720","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[